msgid "源码旁的架构与维护合同"
msgstr "Architecture and maintenance contracts beside the source"

msgid "各层 README 与实现放在一起，作为该目录的架构和维护入口。本页直接包含这些原文， 不复制第二份合同。站点内的源码链接绑定文档对应的 revision；当前实现、软件执行、 候选与实板资格分别记录，不能通过页面发布自动转移。"
msgstr "Each layer keeps its README beside its implementation as the architecture and maintenance entry point for that directory. This page includes those original texts directly instead of duplicating the contracts. Source links on the site bind to the documentation revision. Current implementation, software execution, candidate qualification and physical-board qualification are recorded separately; publishing a page does not transfer them."

msgid "Arm CPU 实现按 ISA 分组，MCU 集成按厂家分组。family 标识、公共 include 路径和 CMake target 是各自明确的接口；目录分组表达源码归属，不增加运行时转发层。"
msgstr "Arm CPU implementations are grouped by ISA, and MCU integration by vendor. Family identifiers, public include paths and CMake targets each form explicit interfaces. Directory grouping expresses source ownership without adding a runtime forwarding layer."

msgid "历史开发资料保存在[证据归档](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/docs/archive/evidence/README.md)，使用原始成员身份和 恢复方法。恢复归档不建立当前源码资格；其中的原始执行范围与失败记录保持不变。"
msgstr "Historical development material remains in the [evidence archive](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/docs/archive/evidence/README.md), with its original member identities and recovery method. Restoring an archive establishes no qualification for current source; its original execution scope and failure records remain unchanged."

msgid "Core"
msgstr "Core"

msgid "Core：请求、时间与生命周期合同"
msgstr "Core: request, time and lifecycle contracts"

msgid "Core 提供调用者持有存储的 C11 请求准入、完成状态、稳定控制身份、单调绝对 截止时间和可选观察。公共头在 `include/nexus/core/`，实现在 `src/`。 它不依赖设备、Arch、OS 或厂商 SDK，没有堆、全局注册表或隐藏执行线程。 I/O 具体实现、责任者和等待适配在这些基础合同上组合具体行为。"
msgstr "Core provides C11 request admission, completion state, stable control identities, monotonic absolute deadlines and optional observation in caller-owned storage. Public headers are in `include/nexus/core/`, with implementations in `src/`. It depends on no devices, Arch, OS or vendor SDK and has no heap, global registry or hidden execution thread. Concrete I/O implementations, owners and wait adapters compose their behavior on these foundational contracts."

msgid "![FIG-06：Core 请求状态与借用](../docs/assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-06: Core request state and borrowing](/assets/diagrams/request-lifecycle.svg)"

msgid "FIG-06：Core 请求状态与借用"
msgstr "FIG-06: Core request state and borrowing"

msgid "图表示当前辅助函数的迁移及调用前提，不承诺每个具体实现都有恢复 API。 图源与范围见[图册](/assets/diagrams/README.md)。"
msgstr "The figure shows transitions of the current helpers and their calling preconditions; it does not promise a recovery API for every implementation. See the [figure atlas](/assets/diagrams/README.md) for source and scope."

