msgstr "Exact silicon-revision admission before acquiring I/O resources"

msgid "请求、唯一执行者与回收"
msgstr "Requests, the sole executor and reclamation"

msgid "REJECTED 不保留引用。接受后的链路借用请求和缓冲区，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED；release 发布 SETTLED 是具体实现最后一次访问请求／有效数据。 取消、超时不撤销借用；排空失败时，QUARANTINED 存储保持有效。等待者观察 锁存状态，唯一执行者推进操作；队列适配器拥有外层请求，必要时使用独立内部 具体实现元数据。"
msgstr "REJECTED retains no references. Once accepted, the chain borrows the request and buffers until SETTLED is observed with acquire semantics; publishing SETTLED with release semantics is the implementation’s final access to the request/payload. Cancellation and timeout do not revoke loans; QUARANTINED storage remains valid after a failed drain. Waiters observe latched state while the sole executor advances the operation. A queue adapter owns the outer request and uses separate internal implementation metadata when needed."

msgid "首次只初始化未发布存储。`nx_request_prepare` 只重置 READY 或已消费结果的 SETTLED 实例代次；它无法发现适配器借用、控制命令或观察者，责任者 必须先等待退出它们。准入和推进由一个串行执行者完成；原子状态通过 release／acquire 形成可观察的判定条件，不是多生产者准入锁，也不依赖通知必达。"
msgstr "Initialize only unpublished storage on first use. `nx_request_prepare` resets an incarnation only in READY or in SETTLED after its result has been consumed. It cannot discover adapter loans, control commands or observers; the owner must first join their departures. One serial executor performs admission and progress. Release/acquire atomic state supplies an observable predicate, not a multi-producer admission lock, and does not depend on guaranteed notification delivery."

msgid "完整关闭顺序："
msgstr "Complete shutdown order:"

msgid "关闭新准入，停止新增控制命令和观察绑定。"
msgstr "Close new admission and stop adding control commands or observer bindings."

msgid "保持唯一执行者取消并排空硬件／IRQ／DMA／延后引用。失败保留 QUARANTINED 请求和有效数据；超时或观察者拆除引用均不允许回收。"
msgstr "Keep the sole executor running to cancel and drain hardware, IRQ, DMA and deferred references. Failure retains the QUARANTINED request and payload; neither timeout nor observer detachment permits reclamation."

msgid "发布 SETTLED 前撤销全部具体实现引用，预先捕获独立存活的唤醒目标。 待发通知不得继续保留请求，结清后不再访问请求／有效数据。"
msgstr "Withdraw every implementation reference before publishing SETTLED, and first capture an independently live wake target. Pending notification must retain no request reference; do not access the request/payload after settlement."

msgid "acquire 观察并消费结果；另行确认排队中的控制命令，等待退出任务、诊断、 完成观察者以及已执行中的调用，在适配器保护区下拆除侧车。"
msgstr "Observe with acquire semantics and consume the result. Separately acknowledge queued control commands; join departing tasks, diagnostics, completion observers and in-flight calls, then detach the sidecar under the adapter guard."

msgid "释放稳定槽位，之后才准备／重新绑定／回收存储。停止依赖前还须等待退出 其他所有使用者。"
msgstr "Release the stable slot before preparing, rebinding or reclaiming storage. Join every other user before stopping dependencies."

msgid "适配器串行保护稳定槽位绑定／查找／释放。代次在该稳定槽位生命周期内 区分实例代次，不是全局通信 ID。`UINT64_MAX` 是最后可用代次；下一次绑定 拒绝且不改稳定槽位／输出。耗尽稳定槽位必须退休，旧命令仍可能访问时不能清零。 替换存储或重启责任者前，先等待退出全部控制者／观察者并撤回旧引用。"
msgstr "The adapter serializes stable-slot bind, lookup and release. An epoch distinguishes incarnations during that stable slot’s lifetime; it is not a global communication ID. `UINT64_MAX` is the last usable epoch; the next bind rejects without changing the stable slot or output. Exhausted slots must retire and must not be reset while old commands can still access them. Before replacing storage or restarting its owner, join all controllers/observers and withdraw old references."

msgid "[UART／SPI 集成测试](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/google/io_owner_diagnostic_pipeline_test.cpp) 使用真实 Native 具体实现与责任者，验证排空失败、恢复结清、观察者拆除引用 后才允许具体实现停止。`core_lifecycle_test.cpp` 检查完整合法迁移矩阵、 准备拒绝、最后可用代次。C 合同的真实线程回归不靠唤醒提示观察发布； 这些测试不授权并发准入或无保护区的稳定槽位操作。"
msgstr "[UART/SPI integration tests](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/google/io_owner_diagnostic_pipeline_test.cpp) use real Native implementations and owners to verify failed drains, recovery settlement and implementation stop only after observer detachment. `core_lifecycle_test.cpp` checks the complete legal transition matrix, prepare rejection and the last usable epoch. Real threaded C-contract regressions observe publication without relying on wake hints. These tests authorize neither concurrent admission nor unguarded stable-slot operations."

msgid "时钟域与有限等待"
msgstr "Clock domains and finite waits"

msgid "`nx_clock32_t` 要求唯一执行者、稳定非零频率和不中断计数器。最大观察间隔 严格小于 `2^32 / frequency_hz` 秒；1 MHz 时是 4294.967296 秒。一整圈后的相同 快照与完全未推进无法区分，辅助函数不能检测漏圈。预算包含空闲阶段、屏蔽状态区间、 Flash 维护、睡眠和责任者最坏延迟。成功时一起提交计数扩展与输出；非法参数、 别名或耗尽不改二者，输出须与完整扩展状态分离。"
msgstr "`nx_clock32_t` requires a sole executor, a stable nonzero frequency and an uninterrupted counter. The maximum observation gap must be strictly less than `2^32 / frequency_hz` seconds: 4294.967296 seconds at 1 MHz. An identical snapshot after a full wrap is indistinguishable from no progress; the helper cannot detect missed wraps. Budget idle periods, masked intervals, Flash maintenance, sleep and the owner’s worst delay. Success commits the extension state and output together. Invalid arguments, overlap or exhaustion leave both unchanged; output must be disjoint from the entire extension state."

msgid "物理时钟另有受审溢出／推进服务合同，通用扩展不能证明具体实现就绪状态。 停止、重启、换源、改频产生新域；撤销旧域前等待退出全部截止时间使用者。 数值相等也不使旧截止时间继续有效；这是生命周期规则，不在每个请求强制 保存代次。终端时钟故障保留借用，并执行所选具体实现保留责任停机。"
msgstr "Physical clocks have separate reviewed overflow/progress service contracts; generic extension cannot establish implementation readiness. Stop, restart, source changes and frequency changes create a new domain. Join every deadline user before withdrawing the old domain. Equal numeric values do not keep old deadlines valid. This is a lifecycle rule, not a mandatory epoch field in every request. A terminal clock fault retains loans and follows the selected implementation’s retained-responsibility shutdown."

msgid "真正有限的等待在准入前调用 `nx_deadline_finite_after(now, duration, &end)` 并 处理失败：拒绝非有限 now 或到哨兵值的求和，失败不改 end，零 duration 合法。 `nx_deadline_after` 仍有饱和为无限等待的明确语义。二者不读时钟、不证明就绪， 零时间值也不构成启动确认。"
msgstr "For a genuinely finite wait, call `nx_deadline_finite_after(now, duration, &end)` before admission and handle failure. It rejects nonfinite now or a sum reaching the sentinel, leaves end unchanged on failure and allows zero duration. `nx_deadline_after` retains its explicit saturation-to-infinite semantics. Neither helper reads the clock or establishes readiness, and a zero time value is not startup confirmation."

msgid "可选观察与故障捕获"
msgstr "Optional observation and fault capture"

msgid "请求观察者提供复制诊断视图，不是另一执行者。间隙／迁移计数 仅是采样观察，不是 IRQ 延迟、WCET 或全部中间迁移。稳定槽位比观察者 活得更久；调用者串行保护采样与请求复用／稳定槽位释放。辅助函数 拒绝输出与已知控制对象重叠，完整请求／有效数据／外部上下文跨度和 存活期仍由调用者保证。"
msgstr "Request observers supply copied diagnostic views, not another executor. Gap/transition counts are sampled observations, not IRQ latency, WCET or all intermediate transitions. Stable slots outlive observers. Callers serialize sampling against request reuse and stable-slot release. Helpers reject output overlap with known control objects; callers remain responsible for the full spans and lifetimes of requests, payloads and external contexts."

msgid "弱 `nx_fault_observe` 默认无状态。产品可写一个有界 C11 覆盖函数，保存到 自有调试器可见记录。下面仅是最小片段，不包含时钟、任务名称或 动态指针："
msgstr "Weak `nx_fault_observe` has no state by default. A product may provide a bounded C11 override that saves a record in its own debugger-visible storage. The following is only a minimal fragment; it includes no clock, task names or dynamic pointers:"

msgid "记录仅供终端停机后尽力取证，不保证并发读者看到一致快照，也不保证嵌套故障安全。`volatile` 不是锁或 release／acquire 协议。产品选择可写内存及保留条件。 钩子不能修复坏栈、建立安全输出、释放借用或依赖时钟、内核、传输层； 不改输入屏蔽状态，返回后终端路径仍保持停机。真实 FreeRTOS 保留责任停机测试检查 钩子、保留请求和 PRIMASK／BASEPRI／FAULTMASK。默认 Core 不加入 快照、队列、工作线程或记录。"
msgstr "The record is only best-effort evidence after terminal shutdown. It guarantees neither coherent snapshots for concurrent readers nor nested-fault safety. `volatile` is neither a lock nor a release/acquire protocol. The product chooses writable memory and retention conditions. The hook cannot repair a corrupt stack, establish safe outputs or release loans, and must not depend on a clock, kernel or transport. It preserves incoming masks; if it returns, the terminal path still remains stopped. Real FreeRTOS retained-shutdown tests check the hook, retained requests and PRIMASK/BASEPRI/FAULTMASK. Default Core adds no snapshot, queue, worker or record."

msgid "栈观察与内存放置"
msgstr "Stack observation and memory placement"

msgid "`nx_stack_observe` 要求外部静止租约：责任者已停／等待退出，读取期间不能 在该栈运行或进入异常。提供原始涂色低地址区，排除活动栈帧、 当前 SP 和独立预算的异常／上下文预留区。启动建立 MSP 涂色 来源，辅助函数不推测。不得涂写仍在执行的栈，也不得为无界扫描长时间屏蔽 IRQ。 成本受字节数约束；预留区或等于涂色的写入可能隐藏使用，结果不是已证明 栈峰值。`tests/google/stack_observation_test.cpp` 覆盖边界、只读、 别名，OS 栈快照另行负责任务上下文规则。"
msgstr "`nx_stack_observe` requires an external quiescence lease: the owner has stopped/joined and neither execution nor an exception may enter that stack during inspection. Supply the original painted low-address region, excluding live frames, the current SP and separately budgeted exception/context reserves. Startup establishes MSP paint provenance; the helper does not infer it. Never paint a live stack or mask IRQs for an unbounded scan. Cost is bounded by bytes. Reserved regions or writes matching the paint can conceal use; the result is not a proven stack peak. `tests/google/stack_observation_test.cpp` covers bounds, read-only access and overlap; OS stack snapshots separately enforce task-context rules."

msgid "放置宏每个声明仅作用一个静态变量定义，且装配已选区域："
msgstr "Each placement-macro declaration applies to exactly one static variable definition, and its assembly must select the region:"

msgid "后缀"
msgstr "Suffix"

msgid "复位初始化"
msgstr "Reset initialization"

msgid "调用者责任"
msgstr "Caller responsibility"

msgid "DATA"
msgstr "DATA"

msgid "从 Flash 拷贝初值"
msgstr "Copy the initializer from Flash"

msgid "同时预算加载／运行"
msgstr "Budget both load and runtime storage"

msgid "BSS"
msgstr "BSS"

msgid "清零"
msgstr "Zero"

msgid "不提供非零初值"
msgstr "Do not supply a nonzero initializer"

msgid "NOINIT"
msgstr "NOINIT"

msgid "不拷贝、不清零"
msgstr "Neither copy nor zero"

msgid "每次读前初始化或验证"
msgstr "Initialize or validate before every read"

msgid "选择 ADDSRAM／TCM／CCM／SRAM1／SRAM4 对应宏，无隐式后备实现。启动／链接器 测试和 ELF 检查拷贝／清零跨度、对齐、GC、预算。NOINIT 不保证复位／ 掉电保留。除非精确 SoC 合同授权所选总线主设备，TCM／CCM 按仅 CPU 处理； 放置不授予 DMA 可达性、Cache 一致性、对齐或借用权限。 默认主栈和普通存储布局保持原选择。"
msgstr "Select the corresponding ADDSRAM/TCM/CCM/SRAM1/SRAM4 macro; there is no implicit fallback implementation. Startup/linker tests and ELF checks cover copy/zero spans, alignment, GC and budgets. NOINIT guarantees neither reset nor power-loss retention. Treat TCM/CCM as CPU-only unless the exact SoC contract authorizes the selected bus master. Placement grants no DMA reachability, Cache coherency, alignment or borrowing permission. Default main-stack and ordinary-storage layouts retain their existing selections."

msgid "精确硅版本与验证"
msgstr "Exact silicon revisions and verification"

msgid "可选冷态 `nx_silicon_preflight` 在调用者建立合法权限／MMIO／安全 后、取得 I/O 资源前读取来源一次，不启时钟、不修硬件。策略、严格排序的 精确修订号规则与审核来源 SHA256 一起维护；摘要标识审核输入， 不是认证或勘误规避措施已应用证明。构建提供经过审核的已应用规避措施位掩码； 明确观察到的修订号数值零合法。"
msgstr "Optional cold `nx_silicon_preflight` reads its source once after the caller establishes legal privilege/MMIO/security and before acquiring I/O resources. It neither enables clocks nor repairs hardware. Maintain policy, strictly ordered exact revision rules and the reviewed source SHA256 together. The digest identifies review inputs; it is neither authentication nor proof that erratum workarounds were applied. The build supplies a reviewed mask of applied workarounds. An explicitly observed numeric revision zero is valid."

msgid "`allow_unreviewed` 不绕过禁止的修订号、缺少观察、设备组／密度 不符或缺少勘误规避措施。完成拒绝会复制原因但不授权启动；来源读取失败保留输出。 设备组／密度不证明封装／PCB／物理资格。 `silicon_admission_test.cpp` 使用真实预检和显式模拟身份来源检查这些区别。"
msgstr "`allow_unreviewed` bypasses neither blocked revisions, missing observations, device-group/density mismatches nor missing erratum workarounds. A completed rejection copies its reason but authorizes no startup; a source-read failure preserves output. Device group/density establishes neither package, PCB nor physical qualification. `silicon_admission_test.cpp` uses real preflight logic and explicit mock identity sources to check these distinctions."

msgid "`tests/contracts/core_contract_test.c` 执行发布、准入、时间回绕和终态不变量。宿主结果不证明 MCU 中断排序或 WCET； 完整范围见[资格说明](/delivery/qualification.md)。"
msgstr "`tests/contracts/core_contract_test.c` exercises publication, admission, time wraparound and terminal-state invariants. Host results establish neither MCU interrupt ordering nor WCET; see [qualification](/delivery/qualification.md) for the full scope."

msgid "Arch"
msgstr "Arch"

msgid "Arch：CPU 原语与显式可选机制"
msgstr "Arch: CPU primitives and explicit optional mechanisms"

msgid "Arch 为 I/O、SoC 和 OS 适配提供 CPU 局部机制。公共头在 `include/nexus/arch/`，Arm Cortex-M 实现在 `arm/cortex_m/`，宿主实现在 `native/`。CPU 事实在构建期选择唯一基础实现，没有运行时 CPU factory。 新架构需要受审实现和编译器合同，不能仅登记名称就宣称支持。"
msgstr "Arch supplies CPU-local mechanisms to I/O, SoC and OS adapters. Public headers are in `include/nexus/arch/`, Arm Cortex-M implementation in `arm/cortex_m/` and host implementation in `native/`. CPU facts select one base implementation at build time; there is no runtime CPU factory. A new architecture needs a reviewed implementation and compiler contract; registering its name alone cannot establish support."

msgid "![FIG-13：Cortex-M 能力分层](../docs/assets/diagrams/cortex-m-capabilities.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-13: Cortex-M capability layers](/assets/diagrams/cortex-m-capabilities.svg)"

msgid "FIG-13：Cortex-M 能力分层"
msgstr "FIG-13: Cortex-M capability layers"

msgid "图区分当前 CPU 原语、Runtime、SoC 接入和实板范围。图源与图例见 [图册](/assets/diagrams/README.md)，规范见 [CPU 契约](/design/arch-contracts.md)。"
msgstr "The figure separates current CPU primitives, Runtime, SoC integration and physical-board scope. See the [figure atlas](/assets/diagrams/README.md) for source and legend, and the [CPU contracts](/design/arch-contracts.md) for normative requirements."

msgid "依赖与源码入口"
msgstr "Dependencies and source entry points"

msgid "`Nexus::Arch` 不调用 I/O、OS 或厂商 SDK，提供屏蔽状态保存恢复、异常身份、权限、 排序屏障和可选已启用 DWT 快照。私有硬件辅助函数内联，正常 ARM 不链接模拟替身； 公共外部函数仍有普通 C 调用边界，不能宣称全部原语零调用成本。"
msgstr "`Nexus::Arch` calls neither I/O, OS nor vendor SDKs. It provides interrupt-mask save/restore, exception identity, privilege, ordering barriers and optional snapshots of an already enabled DWT. Private hardware helpers are inline, and normal ARM builds link no mock substitutes. Public external functions still cross ordinary C call boundaries; do not claim zero call cost for every primitive."

