msgstr "`native/nx_arch_native.c`"

msgid "宿主递归排他和 C11 内存屏障"
msgstr "Host recursive exclusion and C11 memory barriers"

msgid "同一 Cortex-M 实现覆盖 M0／M0+／M3／M4／M7／M23／M33／M55／M85，包括 ARMv8.1-M Mainline 编译器配置组合。F407／F470 首发与 G474／H743／U575 参考范围 由[支持矩阵](/delivery/support.md)限定。CPU 能力不扩大 SoC／Board。 独立 CPU 运行时选择 Core／Arch 和可选 OS，不创建 SoC、Board、启动或 factory；见 [Runtime 装配](/delivery/cortex-m.md)。"
msgstr "One Cortex-M implementation covers M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85, including ARMv8.1-M Mainline compiler profiles. The [support matrix](/delivery/support.md) limits F407/F470 launch scope and G474/H743/U575 reference scope. CPU capabilities do not expand SoC/Board support. A standalone CPU runtime selects Core/Arch and optional OS without creating SoC, Board, startup or factory; see [Runtime assembly](/delivery/cortex-m.md)."

msgid "中断状态、上下文和排序"
msgstr "Interrupt state, context and ordering"

msgid "同 CPU／线程严格逆序使用一次保存／恢复令牌。Cortex-M 保存输入 PRIMASK， 不改 BASEPRI／FAULTMASK。仅特权线程或可配置 IRQ 可以改变屏蔽状态。NMI／HardFault 不被屏蔽，不得访问受保护元数据。临界区不阻塞、分配、大块复制、调用内核或 用户回调。Arch 恢复令牌不代替内核临界区令牌或 SMP 锁。"
msgstr "Use each save/restore token once in strict reverse order on the same CPU/thread. Cortex-M saves incoming PRIMASK and leaves BASEPRI/FAULTMASK unchanged. Only privileged Thread mode or configurable IRQs may change masks. NMI/HardFault are not masked and must not access protected metadata. Critical sections must not block, allocate, copy large buffers, call kernels or invoke user callbacks. An Arch restore token replaces neither a kernel critical-section token nor an SMP lock."

msgid "只读快照区分 PRIMASK、BASEPRI、FAULTMASK，不是恢复令牌，不冻结 IRQ 或另一安全态。M0／M0+／M23 不读不存在的 BASEPRI／FAULTMASK。异常模式即使打断 非特权线程模式也有特权；CONTROL.nPRIV 描述线程模式。异常号只标识当前 CPU／ 安全态，不能据此调用内核 ISR API 或协调另一世界。"
msgstr "Read-only snapshots distinguish PRIMASK, BASEPRI and FAULTMASK. They are not restore tokens and freeze neither IRQs nor the other security state. M0/M0+/M23 do not read absent BASEPRI/FAULTMASK registers. Handler mode is privileged even when it interrupts unprivileged Thread mode; CONTROL.nPRIV describes Thread mode. An exception number identifies only the current CPU/security state; it grants neither permission to call kernel ISR APIs nor coordination with another world."

msgid "DMB／DSB／ISB 提供不同排序保证，不证明外设或 DMA 已静止。DWT 要求显式 受审能力和特权访问；能力关闭时不产生 DWT 读取。快照不启用／ 复位计数器，不是单调截止时间，回绕／频率限制见公共头。能力来自 显式 CPU 事实，不靠试读任意寄存器或暗中开启可选单元。"
msgstr "DMB/DSB/ISB provide distinct ordering guarantees, not proof of peripheral or DMA quiescence. DWT requires an explicit reviewed capability and privileged access; a disabled capability emits no DWT read. A snapshot neither enables nor resets the counter and is not a monotonic deadline. See the public header for wrap/frequency limits. Capabilities come from explicit CPU facts, not speculative register reads or silently enabling optional units."

msgid "原子与存储责任"
msgstr "Atomics and storage responsibility"

msgid "`atomic.h` 区分发布与读改写（RMW），不会静默链接 libatomic。自然对齐字的 acquire 读取和 release 写入不屏蔽 IRQ。M0／M0+ RMW 使用有界 PRIMASK 保存／ 恢复排他区；参与者限同 CPU 的特权线程或可配置 IRQ。NMI、HardFault、 另一核、DMA、另一安全域不在该排他域。"
msgstr "`atomic.h` distinguishes publication from read-modify-write (RMW) and never silently links libatomic. Acquire loads and release stores of naturally aligned words do not mask IRQs. M0/M0+ RMW uses bounded PRIMASK save/restore exclusion, limited to privileged Thread mode or configurable IRQs on the same CPU. NMI, HardFault, another core, DMA and another security domain are outside that exclusion domain."

msgid "其他维护核（包括 M23）用编译器无锁 RMW；独占重试不保证固定 周期上界。发布前初始化字，并保持有效直到每个读取者／写入者停止；这些 操作不自动回收请求、通知或队列。"
msgstr "Other maintained cores, including M23, use compiler lock-free RMW. Exclusive retries have no fixed cycle bound. Initialize words before publication and keep them valid until every reader/writer has stopped; these operations do not automatically reclaim requests, notifications or queues."

msgid "浅睡眠"
msgstr "Shallow sleep"

msgid "`nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt()` 要求特权线程模式、PRIMASK=1、 BASEPRI／FAULTMASK 清除、SCR.SLEEPDEEP 清除；执行 DSB／WFI／ISB，不改变屏蔽状态、时钟或待处理中断状态。调用者完成最终就绪状态检查并提供已启 IRQ 唤醒源。 待处理已启用 IRQ 可在 PRIMASK 屏蔽执行时唤醒 WFI，恢复屏蔽状态后再执行。"
msgstr "`nx_arch_wait_for_interrupt()` requires privileged Thread mode, PRIMASK=1, clear BASEPRI/FAULTMASK and clear SCR.SLEEPDEEP. It executes DSB/WFI/ISB without changing masks, clocks or pending-interrupt state. The caller performs the final readiness check and supplies an enabled IRQ wake source. A pending enabled IRQ can wake WFI while PRIMASK masks execution; the IRQ executes after masks are restored."

msgid "`nx_arch_idle_if_unchanged()` 要求输入屏蔽状态全清，保存 PRIMASK，以 acquire 重查对齐已发布序列，仅与调用者快照相同时睡眠，最后恢复原值。醒后 重查权威判定条件，有限截止时间另提供 IRQ 定时器。证明域限单 CPU／安全态， 排除 NMI／HardFault、DMA、SMP、另一世界发布者。Native 返回不支持。模型／ 编译不建立实际定时器、时钟连续性、功耗或唤醒延迟资格。"
msgstr "`nx_arch_idle_if_unchanged()` requires all incoming masks clear. It saves PRIMASK and rechecks an aligned published sequence with acquire semantics, sleeping only if it matches the caller’s snapshot, then restores the original value. Recheck the authoritative predicate after waking; finite deadlines need a separate IRQ timer. The proof domain is one CPU/security state and excludes NMI/HardFault, DMA, SMP and other-world publishers. Native returns unsupported. Models/compilation establish no qualification for actual timers, clock continuity, power or wake latency."

msgid "Cache、MPU 与安全域"
msgstr "Cache, MPU and security domains"

msgid "`cache.h` 区分清理、失效、清理并失效、指令同步。 范围须独占完整受审的 32 B 缓存行、适合 CPU 地址空间，并排除 CPU、DMA 和其他安全域的并发使用。不向外取整、不启用 Cache、不处理无关的脏缓存行。"
msgstr "`cache.h` distinguishes clean, invalidate, clean-and-invalidate and instruction synchronization. Ranges must exclusively own complete reviewed 32 B cache lines, fit the CPU address space and exclude concurrent CPU, DMA or other-security-domain use. It neither rounds outward, enables Cache nor handles unrelated dirty lines."

msgid "`cache_control.h` 单独负责 M7 冷态启停。调用者提供零初始化控制对象，屏蔽可配置 IRQ 并排除 DMA 和其他内存使用者。可信复位或此前成功的自有清理／关闭 建立冷态前提，CCR 清位不能证明外来脏行不存在。启用拒绝已有 Cache； 关闭时清理全部受审缓存组／路，由不写脏自身栈的叶函数修改 CCR。部分失败 保留 Cache／CSSELR 恢复责任。实际 O0／Os／O2 指令审查检查地址、循环、屏障； 其他 CPU 范围维护不代表已审核全局冷态控制。"
msgstr "`cache_control.h` separately owns M7 cold enable/disable. The caller supplies a zero-initialized control object, masks configurable IRQs and excludes DMA and other memory users. Trusted reset or a previously successful owned clean/disable establishes the cold precondition; clear CCR bits do not prove absence of foreign dirty lines. Enable rejects an already enabled Cache. Disable cleans all reviewed sets/ways and modifies CCR through a leaf function that does not dirty its own stack. Partial failure retains Cache/CSSELR restoration responsibility. Actual O0/Os/O2 instruction audits check addresses, loops and barriers. Range maintenance on other CPUs does not imply reviewed global cold control."

msgid "`mpu.h` 分别保留 v7 格式和 v8 基址／上界／MAIR 编码器。单区域编程要求 已经屏蔽可配置中断的特权线程，且 MPU 已关闭；写前查真实 TYPE 上限及字段， 保留 CTRL、输入 RNR。内存策略和后续启用属调用者。可选 M0+ MPU 用 CMSIS 核对的 v7 格式。成功表示校验写入与屏障，不含读回或已启用 策略验证。"
msgstr "`mpu.h` keeps separate v7-format and v8 base/limit/MAIR encoders. Single-region programming requires privileged Thread mode with configurable interrupts already masked and the MPU disabled. Check actual TYPE bounds and fields before writes; preserve CTRL and incoming RNR. Memory policy and later enable belong to the caller. The optional M0+ MPU uses a CMSIS-checked v7 format. Success means validated writes and barriers, not readback or validation of an enabled policy."

msgid "`security.h` 查询受审镜像状态并编码显式 SAU 区域。仅 Secure 编译器／ 配置组合与受审 SAU 能力能写自有区域，要求 SAU 已关闭、特权线程模式 已置 PRIMASK。API 不改 CTRL／ALLNS、其他区域、网关或另一世界别名。 NonSecure／单状态不做 SAU MMIO 并返回不支持；IDAU、重叠、内存 权限和网关策略归外部集成。"
msgstr "`security.h` queries the reviewed image state and encodes explicit SAU regions. Only a Secure compiler/profile with a reviewed SAU capability may write owned regions, with SAU disabled and PRIMASK set in privileged Thread mode. The API leaves CTRL/ALLNS, other regions, gateways and other-world aliases unchanged. NonSecure/single-state builds perform no SAU MMIO and return unsupported. External integration owns IDAU, overlap, memory permissions and gateway policy."

msgid "`nonsecure.h` 用真实 CMSE 瞬时观察完整跨度的 NS 非特权读取／读写 权限；IDAU 已建立归属时不需要可编程 SAU。Native、单状态、 NonSecure 不跨域并返回不支持。成功不固定、复制、认证、排除 MMIO 或 冻结映射／DMA／总线防火墙；SoC／网关责任者另建立这些前提。"
msgstr "`nonsecure.h` uses real CMSE to observe NS unprivileged read/read-write permission over the entire span at that instant. A programmable SAU is unnecessary when IDAU already establishes attribution. Native, single-state and NonSecure builds do not cross domains and return unsupported. Success neither pins, copies or authenticates memory, excludes MMIO nor freezes mappings/DMA/bus firewalls; SoC/gateway owners establish those preconditions separately."

msgid "Native、官方事实与验证"
msgstr "Native, official facts and verification"

msgid "`features.h` 报告不可变受审 Cache／MPU／DWT／安全／SAU 能力，不是已启用 状态或硬件资格。Native 提供硬件不存在结果，纯编码器仍可用。CPU 机制 不提供 SoC 启动、向量表、时钟树、内存／DMA 路线、Board 接线或 RTOS FP／MVE 上下文端口，各平台分别提供和验证。"
msgstr "`features.h` reports immutable reviewed Cache/MPU/DWT/security/SAU capabilities, not enabled state or hardware qualification. Native reports absent hardware while pure encoders remain usable. CPU mechanisms provide no SoC startup, vector tables, clock trees, memory/DMA routes, Board wiring or RTOS FP/MVE context ports; each platform supplies and verifies those separately."

msgid "Native 用递归排他和 C11 内存屏障，不模拟 NVIC、DMA、物理时间或 信号处理安全中断。Debug／Release 对非法恢复嵌套均中止。九核 GoogleTest／ GoogleMock 编译真实 Cortex-M 算法，仅替换窄寄存器／指令边界；Cache／MPU／ Security 模型也只替换外部 CPU／MMIO 操作，覆盖变更前拒绝。Native 测试执行真实 排他、令牌嵌套和上下文查询。"
msgstr "Native uses recursive exclusion and C11 memory barriers. It simulates neither NVIC, DMA, physical time nor signal-handler-safe interrupts. Invalid restore nesting aborts in both Debug and Release. GoogleTest/GoogleMock tests for nine CPU profiles compile real Cortex-M algorithms and replace only narrow register/instruction boundaries. Cache/MPU/Security models likewise replace only external CPU/MMIO operations and cover rejection before mutation. Native tests execute real exclusion, token nesting and context queries."

msgid "CMSIS-Core v6.4.0 的 `core_cm0plus.h`、`core_cm7.h`、`core_cm23.h`、 `core_cm33.h`、`core_cm55.h`、`core_cm85.h`、`m-profile/armv7m_mpu.h`、 `m-profile/armv8m_mpu.h` 和 `m-profile/armv7m_cachel1.h` 是受审布局参考。 私有 `registers.h` 集中已用当前域地址； `tests/contracts/arch_cmsis_layout_probe.c` 独立核对九核 MPU／SAU／Cache 字段。 编译门禁核对 CMSIS-Core 为锁定的精确版本、工作树干净，并检查真实 include 来源。生产目标保持 Nexus 接口依赖边界；共享官方 Core 不改变上下文、所有权、屏蔽恢复或可选机制合同， 也不建立新处理器／配置组合／物理支持。"
msgstr "CMSIS-Core v6.4.0 `core_cm0plus.h`, `core_cm7.h`, `core_cm23.h`, `core_cm33.h`, `core_cm55.h`, `core_cm85.h`, `m-profile/armv7m_mpu.h`, `m-profile/armv8m_mpu.h` and `m-profile/armv7m_cachel1.h` are reviewed layout references. Private `registers.h` centralizes the current-domain addresses in use. `tests/contracts/arch_cmsis_layout_probe.c` independently checks MPU/SAU/Cache fields across nine CPU profiles. Compile gates verify the exact locked CMSIS-Core version, a clean working tree and actual include origins. Production targets preserve Nexus interface dependency boundaries. Sharing official Core headers changes neither context, ownership, mask restoration nor optional-mechanism contracts and establishes no new processor/profile/physical support."

msgid "`scripts/ci/arch_compile.py` 用真实 GNU ARM O2 编译声明的 CPU／FPU／MVE／安全／ DSP ABI。生产原子探针保留九个操作，按函数审查屏蔽状态、恢复屏障、 发布、独占 RMW，并以重定位关联 M0／M0+ IRQ 端口。静态指令数 不约束重试，不建立时序、唤醒延迟或 WCET。ARM Clang、SoC 启动、 Board 接线和实际 IRQ 延迟、权限迁移、DMA／Cache 一致性、 CPU 时序各有独立证据范围，物理行为仍须 HIL。"
msgstr "`scripts/ci/arch_compile.py` uses real GNU ARM O2 compilation for declared CPU/FPU/MVE/security/DSP ABIs. Production atomic probes retain nine operations and audit masks, restore barriers, publication and exclusive RMW per function; relocations associate M0/M0+ IRQ ports. Static instruction counts bound neither retries nor timing, wake latency or WCET. ARM Clang, SoC startup, Board wiring, actual IRQ latency, privilege transitions, DMA/Cache coherency and CPU timing each have separate evidence scopes. Physical behavior still requires HIL."

msgid "类型化 I/O"
msgstr "Typed I/O"

msgid "I/O：类型化接口与共享执行机制"
msgstr "I/O: typed interfaces and shared execution mechanisms"

msgid "I/O 为应用和组件提供公共 C11 类型，为 SoC 的具体实现规定操作、借用与退出 合同。公共类型不含厂商 Handle 或寄存器布局。实际模式和受审路线以 [能力矩阵](/delivery/capabilities.md)为准；公共头存在不代表每颗芯片实现 全部操作，也不授权未知 PCB 接线。"
msgstr "I/O provides public C11 types for applications and components, and operation, borrowing and exit contracts for concrete SoC implementations. Public types contain no vendor Handles or register layouts. Actual modes and reviewed routes follow the [capability matrix](/delivery/capabilities.md). Public headers do not imply that every chip implements every operation or authorize unknown PCB wiring."

msgid "![FIG-04：factory 与静态实例](../docs/assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-04: factory and static instances](/assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"

msgid "FIG-04：factory 与静态实例"
msgstr "FIG-04: factory and static instances"

msgid "该图是精确参考装配，区分已有接口对象、共享方法表与独立上下文；查找不启动 硬件。当前通用装配与执行另见 [FIG-16](../docs/assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg)，范围与图例见 [图册](/assets/diagrams/README.md)。"
msgstr "This figure is an exact reference assembly that distinguishes existing interface objects, shared method tables and independent contexts. Lookup does not start hardware. See [FIG-16](/assets/diagrams/io-evolution.svg) for current generic assembly and execution, and the [figure atlas](/assets/diagrams/README.md) for scope and legend."

