msgid "`../soc/<vendor>/<family>/drivers/`"
msgstr "`../soc/<vendor>/<family>/drivers/`"

msgid "精确 MCU 具体实现和模式"
msgstr "Exact MCU implementations and modes"

msgid "物理 Platform 按 CMake 源码合同编译选定控制器域与组件依赖；空装配仍有时间戳 和诊断辅助。Native 与仅复用 CPU 的 Runtime 保留公共合同以接纳调用者自定义实现。所有配置组合可见公共头，未选操作 不成为第二个隐式具体实现；编译选择与最终 ELF GC 分别测量。"
msgstr "Physical Platform builds selected controller domains and component dependencies under the CMake source contract. Empty assemblies still have timestamp and diagnostic helpers. Native and CPU-only Runtime retain public contracts for caller-provided implementations. Public headers are visible to every profile; unselected operations do not become a second implicit implementation. Compile selection and final ELF GC are measured separately."

msgid "组件目标自己声明 I/O 域依赖。如 `Nexus::TMP117I2C` 链接 `Nexus::IOI2C`，外部资源责任者可提供端点，无需在装配中虚构物理控制器。 域静态库在选择或链接前排除构建，共享机制只编译一次；可选目标 仍可能出现在 `compile_commands.json`，实际选中的 Ninja 命令闭包和一次新构建 才能证明编译了什么。"
msgstr "Component targets declare their own I/O-domain dependencies. For example, `Nexus::TMP117I2C` links `Nexus::IOI2C`; external resource owners may supply endpoints without inventing a physical controller in the assembly. Domain static libraries are excluded from building until selected or linked, and shared mechanisms compile once. Optional targets can still appear in `compile_commands.json`; the actual selected Ninja command closure and a fresh build establish what compiled."

msgid "静态实例与多态调用"
msgstr "Static instances and polymorphic calls"

msgid "每个选定实例具有只读接口对象，保存共享只读方法表和独立私有上下文。32 位 目标接口对象本身为 8 B，只读方法表、可变状态、选定缓冲区、已链接代码 另算。生成实例用精确静态存储，显式构造器用责任者提供的存储。"
msgstr "Each selected instance has a read-only interface object containing a shared read-only method table and an independent private context. The interface object itself is 8 B on a 32-bit target; count read-only tables, mutable state, selected buffers and linked code separately. Generated instances use exact static storage; explicit constructors use owner-provided storage."

msgid "公共 API 验证接口对象后执行 `ops(context, ...)`，具体实现寄存器热路径可以私有 直接调用。缺失可选方法返回 `NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`。不同具体实现／ 模式表共存，不替换公共符号；IRQ 固定绑定实例，不逐字节查 factory。"
msgstr "The public API validates an interface object before calling `ops(context, ...)`; register hot paths may call private functions directly. Absent optional methods return `NX_ERROR_UNSUPPORTED`. Tables for different implementations/modes coexist without replacing public symbols. IRQs bind directly to instances instead of looking up the factory per byte."

msgid "factory 查询函数返回已有身份。查找、Platform 启动、请求准入、 推进服务、恢复、停止分开。SPI／I2C 控制器与端点身份独立，新产品 用强类型引用头文件；见[factory 合同](/explanation/factory.md)。"
msgstr "Factory queries return existing identities. Lookup, Platform startup, request admission, service, recovery and stop are separate. SPI/I2C controller and endpoint identities are independent. New products use strong-reference headers; see the [factory contract](/explanation/factory.md)."

msgid "RS485 适配器用同一强类型 UART 引用取得 `nx_factory_uart_ref` 和 `nx_factory_uart_tx_validator_ref`。仅受审精确模式导出回调，其他模式／ 非法 ID 返回 NULL。查询不分配存储、不操作硬件、不准入传输；回调不是实例认证，调用者 配对精确上下文并独占 TX，提供稳定适配器／配置、GPIO 方向接口对象、 极性、方向建立／保持时长。不新增角色框架、每 UART 状态或方法表字段。"
msgstr "The RS485 adapter uses the same strong UART reference to obtain `nx_factory_uart_ref` and `nx_factory_uart_tx_validator_ref`. Only reviewed exact modes export callbacks; other modes/invalid IDs return NULL. Lookup neither allocates storage, touches hardware nor admits transfers. The callback is not instance authentication. Callers pair the exact context, own TX exclusively and supply stable adapter/configuration storage, a GPIO direction interface, polarity and direction setup/hold times. It adds no role framework, per-UART state or method-table field."

msgid "控制器、并行端点和内存窗口"
msgstr "Controllers, parallel endpoints and memory windows"

msgid "外部总线路径分开共享 `nx_external_bus_port_t`、显示存储体 `nx_parallel16_endpoint_t`、SRAM 存储体 `nx_memory_window_port_t`。Platform 在 C 中准备控制器并获取显示存储体；factory 只返回稳定接口对象。并行字 调用同步完成，每次返回前结束所有 CPU 存储跨度的访问；显示组件消费公共端点／只读配置， SoC 不导入组件协议或公开厂商类型。"
msgstr "The external-bus path separates shared `nx_external_bus_port_t`, display-bank `nx_parallel16_endpoint_t` and SRAM-bank `nx_memory_window_port_t`. Platform prepares the controller and acquires the display bank in C; factory only returns stable interface objects. Parallel-word calls complete synchronously, ending all CPU-span access before each return. Display components consume public endpoints/read-only configuration; SoC imports no component protocols and does not expose vendor types publicly."

msgid "内存窗口借用返回地址、字节数和代次，后续 CPU 直接读写该地址， 无逐访问分派。释放原稳定借用前须等待退出所有派生指针使用者。 `cpu-window` 与 `startup-memory` 是独立显式模式；后者整个镜像生命周期 持有 SRAM，不发放与已放置的全局对象重叠的整存储体借用。C 责任记录在 Platform 启动前已持有承载内存，上下文／预检／身份／启动失败都不能 抹除。全局停止在撤共享引脚／系统时钟前报告保留责任。几何 只描述选定事实，不证明实物焊接配置／时序；两类接口对象都不授予 DMA、 堆、外部栈或可执行内存权限。"
msgstr "A memory-window loan returns an address, byte count and epoch. Subsequent CPU accesses use that address directly without per-access dispatch. Join every derived-pointer user before releasing the original stable loan. `cpu-window` and `startup-memory` are separate explicit modes. The latter holds SRAM for the entire image lifetime and issues no whole-bank loan overlapping placed globals. C ownership records already own the backing memory before Platform startup; context, preflight, identity or startup failure must not erase them. Global stop reports retained responsibility before withdrawing shared pins/system clocks. Geometry describes only selected facts, not physical population/timing. Neither interface grants DMA, heap, external-stack or executable-memory permission."

msgid "借用、进度与排空"
msgstr "Borrowing, progress and draining"

msgid "直接路径在允许上下文中由一个串行执行者推进。请求和有效数据 始终调用者持有，但借用持续到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。取消／截止时间／失败 排空不撤销借用；具体实现先撤硬件／IRQ／延后引用，最后以 release 发布。QUARANTINED 保留存储和清理责任。 [所有权表](/explanation/ownership.md)区分直接、固定 IRQ、跨任务 适配器、等待与停机。"
msgstr "One serial executor advances the direct path in an allowed context. Callers always own request and payload storage, but the loan lasts until SETTLED is observed with acquire semantics. Cancellation, deadlines and failed drains do not revoke loans. Implementations withdraw hardware/IRQ/deferred references before final release publication. QUARANTINED retains storage and cleanup responsibility. The [ownership table](/explanation/ownership.md) separates direct calls, fixed IRQs, cross-task adapters, waiting and shutdown."

msgid "DMA 内存完成、线上完成、请求结清是独立事实。 具体实现检查精确可达性、选定域、Cache 所有权和真实 撤销。有限与连续传输各有明确的借用、重新武装接收和背压合同。默认没有 强制 OS 锁、隐藏驱动任务、通用缓冲区池；精确范围见 [DMA／stream 合同](/design/io-evolution.md)。"
msgstr "DMA memory completion, wire completion and request settlement are independent facts. Implementations check exact reachability, selected domains, Cache ownership and actual withdrawal. Finite and continuous transfers have explicit borrowing, receive-rearm and backpressure contracts. Default operation adds no mandatory OS lock, hidden driver task or generic buffer pool; see the [DMA/stream contract](/design/io-evolution.md) for exact scope."

msgid "流的 reserve／publish／acquire／release／abort／stop 操作只访问与块数无关的 固定数量的元数据。停止时检查未归还计数，不在屏蔽 IRQ 的区间扫描或撤销已借用块。冷态 重叠验证检查完整选定块组，是不同成本；复杂度不证明 IRQ 延迟。"
msgstr "Stream reserve/publish/acquire/release/abort/stop operations touch a fixed amount of metadata independent of block count. Stop checks outstanding counts without scanning or revoking borrowed blocks under IRQ masks. Cold overlap validation checks the full selected block group and has a different cost; complexity does not establish IRQ latency."

msgid "`nx_dma_storage_validate` 分开验证整个预留区和有效数据。例如对齐 64 B 预留区可承载 17 B 有效数据并独占两条 32 B 缓存行，具体实现仍可施加 更严格模式约束。地址／容量须满足对齐、完整 DMA 可见域、 可选整行几何；不取整、不分配、不隐藏中转缓冲区。 调用者给出受审几何／独占所有权，具体实现另验证模式／能力并 执行必要 Cache 维护。取消／截止时间不允许在排空并以 acquire 观察 SETTLED 前复用。"
msgstr "`nx_dma_storage_validate` validates the complete reservation separately from the payload. For example, an aligned 64 B reservation may carry 17 B of payload while exclusively owning two 32 B cache lines; an implementation can still impose stricter mode constraints. Address/capacity must satisfy alignment, a complete DMA-visible domain and optional whole-line geometry. It neither rounds, allocates nor hides bounce buffers. Callers supply reviewed geometry/exclusive ownership; implementations separately validate modes/capabilities and perform required Cache maintenance. Cancellation/deadlines do not permit reuse before draining and observing SETTLED with acquire semantics."

msgid "观察、USB 激活与证据"
msgstr "Observation, USB activation and evidence"

msgid "`nexus/io/diagnostic.h` 组合复制的请求／流观察与明确已知的生命周期、 责任者准入、推进服务时间、观察者等待退出事实，独立保留发现项位／ 未知分组。请求不变不证明未调用 service；服务间隔判定必须有同一单调域中的时间戳与预算。辅助函数和原因键不读取实时硬件状态，不改变 所有权、不推进或恢复设备。SETTLED 不证明传输成功或观察者已等待退出。 流的未归还计数包括生产者、待消费和消费者持有的借用，普通游标的 忙不描述私有预提交游标；未知保留，零发现项不证明健康。"
msgstr "`nexus/io/diagnostic.h` combines copied request/stream observations with explicitly known lifecycle, owner admission, service-time and observer-join facts. It retains finding bits and unknown groups separately. An unchanged request does not prove service was not called; service-gap evaluation needs timestamps and budgets in the same monotonic domain. Helpers and reason keys read no live hardware state, change no ownership and neither service nor recover devices. SETTLED proves neither successful transfer nor observer departure. Stream outstanding counts include producer, pending and consumer loans; an ordinary cursor’s busy state says nothing about a private precommit cursor. Unknowns remain unknown; zero findings do not establish health."

msgid "可选 [USB activation](/design/usb-device.md)保留独立不可变接口对象和 既有上下文。非零端点设置方法是有界控制器动作；外部 Chapter 9 策略拥有配置、回滚、普通数据包准入。不增加 默认工作线程或配置事务，公共声明保留上下文、部分效果 和完整停止责任。"
msgstr "Optional [USB activation](/design/usb-device.md) keeps a separate immutable interface object with the existing context. Nonzero endpoint setters are bounded controller actions; external Chapter 9 policy owns configuration, rollback and ordinary packet admission. It adds neither a default worker nor a configuration transaction. Public declarations retain context, partial-effect and complete-stop responsibilities."

msgid "Native、生产寄存器模型、选定 ARM 链接、物理 HIL 证明不同 性质。独立实例或目录组织不建立电气、实测时序或任意负载下无损；MCU 物理 HIL 保持 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "Native, production-register models, selected ARM links and physical HIL establish different properties. Independent instances or directory organization establish neither electrical behavior, measured timing nor losslessness under arbitrary load. MCU physical HIL remains `not_executed`."

msgid "OS 适配"
msgstr "OS adaptation"

msgid "OS：可选等待与内核适配"
msgstr "OS: optional waiting and kernel adaptation"

msgid "OS 层提供公共等待／唤醒合同和后端专用静态对象 API。裸机没有调度器，Native 使用 POSIX 线程，FreeRTOS 使用调用者明确选择的 TCB、栈和队列存储。 没有通用最大对象池、隐藏产品工作线程、默认定时器后台任务，也不让设备依赖 OS。"
msgstr "The OS layer provides public wait/wake contracts and backend-specific static-object APIs. Bare metal has no scheduler, Native uses POSIX threads, and FreeRTOS uses caller-selected TCB, stack and queue storage. There is no universal maximum-object pool, hidden product worker or default timer daemon, and devices do not depend on an OS."

msgid "![FIG-08：等待、唤醒与外部退出](../docs/assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-08: waiting, wake and external shutdown](/assets/diagrams/wait-wake-shutdown.svg)"

msgid "FIG-08：等待、唤醒与外部退出"
msgstr "FIG-08: waiting, wake and external shutdown"

msgid "图表达当前“检查就绪 → 登记等待 → 再检查 → 等待 → 重查”及退出会合责任；图源、范围见 [图册](/assets/diagrams/README.md)。它不建立物理时序资格。"
msgstr "The figure describes the current “check readiness → arm wait → recheck → wait → recheck” sequence and shutdown join responsibilities. See the [figure atlas](/assets/diagrams/README.md) for source and scope. It establishes no physical timing qualification."

msgid "分层与使用入口"
msgstr "Layers and entry points"

msgid "公共抽象只有等待／唤醒端口。任务、队列、等待退出和存储 API 保持后端专用， 暴露真实内核控制块需求。产品换内核时显式调整任务生命周期，不存在统一 Task／ Queue ABI 或最大存储池。"
msgstr "Only wait/wake ports form the common abstraction. Task, queue, join and storage APIs remain backend-specific and expose real kernel-control-block requirements. Products explicitly adapt task lifecycles when changing kernels; there is no universal Task/Queue ABI or maximum storage pool."

msgid "内容"
msgstr "Contents"

msgid "`include/nexus/os/wait.h`、`wait.c`"
msgstr "`include/nexus/os/wait.h`、`wait.c`"

msgid "公共判定条件等待和等待选择"
msgstr "Common predicate waiting and wait selection"

msgid "`baremetal/`"
msgstr "`baremetal/`"

msgid "非阻塞序列通知，无隐式调度器／WFI"
msgstr "Nonblocking sequence notification without an implicit scheduler/WFI"

msgid "`native/`"
msgstr "`native/`"

msgid "宿主线程、通知、队列和等待退出"
msgstr "Host threads, notifications, queues and join"

msgid "`freertos/`"
msgstr "`freertos/`"

msgid "静态 FreeRTOS 任务／队列／通知"
msgstr "Static FreeRTOS tasks, queues and notifications"

msgid "`freertos/mpu/`、`freertos/secure/`"
msgstr "`freertos/mpu/`、`freertos/secure/`"

msgid "显式可选 MPU／分域安全配置组合"
msgstr "Explicit optional MPU/split-security profiles"

msgid "`threadx/`"
msgstr "`threadx/`"

msgid "真实 ThreadX Linux／M4 的明确适配范围"
msgstr "Explicit adaptation scope for real ThreadX Linux/M4 kernels"

msgid "通知只是提示，调用者通过登记等待／复查观察权威请求判定条件。 内核 ISR 操作验证选定系统调用上限。Native 任务返回结束 pthread； FreeRTOS 适配层发布完成后挂起，待外部删除；ThreadX 适配层 进入真实内核完成。唯一外部生命周期责任者成功等待退出后才回收适配层、 TCB、栈、上下文；完成提示不证明内核已拆除引用。应用拥有调度器 启动、工作线程、队列深度、公平性和停机执行进度。"
msgstr "Notifications are hints; callers arm/recheck to observe the authoritative request predicate. Kernel ISR operations validate the selected syscall ceiling. Returning from a Native task ends its pthread. The FreeRTOS adapter publishes completion and suspends pending external deletion; the ThreadX adapter reaches real kernel completion. Only a successful join by the sole external lifecycle owner permits reclamation of adapter, TCB, stack and context storage; a completion hint does not prove kernel detachment. Applications own scheduler startup, workers, queue depth, fairness and shutdown progress."

msgid "CPU、上下文与启动"
msgstr "CPU, context and startup"

msgid "FreeRTOS POSIX 验证夹具执行真实调度器和任务／队列生命周期。普通特权 运行时按受审 CPU 事实选精确锁定端口：M0／M0+ 用 CM0，M3／无 FP M4 用 CM3， FP M4 用 CM4F，FP M7 用 CM7/r0p1，CM23／33／55／85 用各自 NTZ 端口和独立 ASM。 仅整数 M7 用受审构建期派生 CM3 端口，含保存 PRIMASK 的勘误 837070 保护区，厂商字节不改。宿主执行不证明 MCU 异常优先级、FP／MVE 上下文、 栈高水位或时序。"
msgstr "The FreeRTOS POSIX fixture executes the real scheduler and task/queue lifecycles. Ordinary privileged runtimes select exact locked ports from reviewed CPU facts: CM0 for M0/M0+, CM3 for M3/non-FP M4, CM4F for FP M4, CM7/r0p1 for FP M7, and each core’s NTZ port plus separate ASM for CM23/33/55/85. Integer-only M7 uses a reviewed build-time-derived CM3 port with an erratum 837070 exclusion that preserves PRIMASK; vendor bytes remain unchanged. Host execution establishes neither MCU exception priorities, FP/MVE context, stack high-water marks nor timing."

msgid "运行 API 要求特权线程模式，且 PRIMASK、BASEPRI、FAULTMASK 均清零。 调度器启动前有独立例外：Baseline 端口可保留 PRIMASK=1，Mainline 可保留 精确的系统调用 BASEPRI；仅接受该端口的规范引导屏蔽状态。数值匹配不能证明 调用者拥有屏蔽状态的控制权。故障屏蔽或其他屏蔽状态在对象变更前拒绝； 只读调度器查询区分内核引导、运行中任务和调度器暂停期间的任务。 Baseline IRQ 唤醒遵守 PRIMASK 内核合同，Mainline 还验证实际边界、 优先级位宽和系统调用上限。"
msgstr "Runtime APIs require privileged Thread mode with PRIMASK, BASEPRI and FAULTMASK all clear. Before scheduler startup, a separate exception permits PRIMASK=1 for Baseline ports or the exact syscall BASEPRI for Mainline, accepting only that port’s canonical bootstrap masks. Matching values do not prove the caller owns the masks. Fault masks or other mask states reject before object mutation. Read-only scheduler queries distinguish kernel bootstrap, running tasks and tasks during scheduler suspension. Baseline IRQ wake follows the PRIMASK kernel contract; Mainline also validates the actual boundary, priority width and syscall ceiling."

msgid "首次调度器启动要求冷态特权线程模式／MSP，CONTROL.FPCA 清零；应用 不能在内核引导前遗留活动 FP 上下文。MPU 启动保护区依据真实来源／栈帧 消费受保护单次使用租约。v8-M `security = \"single\"` 是 Arch 状态 0， 不是 Nonsecure；它使用传统 FD／F9 返回组合，但没有 CMSE 权限。显式 Secure 使用相同组合和独立 Secure 事实，Nonsecure 用 BC／B8。 `NEXUS_CPU_SECURE_ONLY` 仅选择端口编码，不授予单世界 Secure 权限。"
msgstr "First scheduler startup requires cold privileged Thread mode/MSP and clear CONTROL.FPCA; applications must not leave active FP context before kernel bootstrap. MPU startup exclusion consumes a protected single-use lease based on actual provenance/frames. v8-M `security = \"single\"` is Arch state 0, not Nonsecure. It uses traditional FD/F9 return encodings without CMSE authority. Explicit Secure uses the same encodings with separate Secure facts; Nonsecure uses BC/B8. `NEXUS_CPU_SECURE_ONLY` only selects port encoding and grants no Secure authority to a single-world image."

msgid "MPU、TrustZone 与 FP／MVE"
msgstr "MPU, TrustZone and FP/MVE"

msgid "Armv8-M 明确选择 NTZ、仅安全态或 Nonsecure 独立。NTZ 内核不分配 Secure 任务上下文、不开放跨世界 Secure 调用。Secure 启动负责 SAU／IDAU 和 Nonsecure 协处理器访问。NS 本地中断屏蔽不能阻止 Secure 发布者并发 访问受保护状态。"
msgstr "Armv8-M explicitly selects NTZ, Secure-only or standalone Nonsecure. NTZ kernels allocate no Secure task context and expose no cross-world Secure calls. Secure startup owns SAU/IDAU and Nonsecure coprocessor access. NS-local interrupt masks cannot exclude Secure publishers from concurrent protected-state access."

msgid "默认任务 API 仍只允许特权调用。显式 MPU 配置组合有独立静态受限任务 生命周期，默认只开放无指针的延时／节拍 SVC。调用者提供受保护 元数据和受审用户链接器区域，不开放通用用户对象池或特权 I/O。M0／M0+、M7 MPU 与 MPU＋分域安全组合拒绝；详见 [MPU 入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/mpu/README.md)和[OS 合同](/design/os-contracts.md)。"
msgstr "Default task APIs still permit privileged callers only. Explicit MPU profiles have separate static restricted-task lifecycles and expose only pointer-free delay/tick SVCs by default. Callers supply protected metadata and reviewed user linker regions; there is no generic user-object pool or privileged I/O access. M0/M0+, M7 MPU and MPU plus split-security combinations reject. See the [MPU entry point](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/mpu/README.md) and [OS contracts](/design/os-contracts.md)."

msgid "分域模式选择真实具备 TrustZone 上下文支持的 NS 端口，另链接 Secure 裸机 Runtime 与 `Nexus::SecureContext`。两幅镜像匹配 CPU／ABI，并使用真实 CMSE 导入／SG。 包括 Idle 的每个授权任务都有调用者持有 NS TCB／栈和不可变受信 映射选择的已准备 Secure 元数据／栈。无 Secure 堆／最大上下文池。 NS 特权内核受信，SAU／IDAU、启动、向量、NSC 归属、IRQ 路由属消费方／SoC。见 [Secure companion](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/secure/README.md)。 两幅镜像链接／宿主租约测试不证明物理归属、上下文保留、 栈峰值或对抗恶意 NS 内核的隔离。"
msgstr "Split mode selects a real NS port with TrustZone context support and separately links a Secure bare-metal Runtime with `Nexus::SecureContext`. Both images match CPU/ABI and use real CMSE imports/SG. Every authorized task, including Idle, has caller-owned NS TCB/stack storage and prepared Secure metadata/stacks selected by an immutable trusted mapping. There is no Secure heap or maximum-context pool. The privileged NS kernel is trusted. Consumers/SoC own SAU/IDAU, startup, vectors, NSC attribution and IRQ routing. See the [Secure companion](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/os/freertos/secure/README.md). Paired-image links and host lease tests establish neither physical attribution, context retention, stack peaks nor isolation from a malicious NS kernel."

msgid "M55／M85 使用真实具备 MVE 上下文支持的上下文端口。`configENABLE_FPU` 为 FP 或 MVE 开启共享协处理器寄存器组与扩展／惰性栈帧，标量 FP 事实独立。 仅整数 MVE 用 `+nofp` 和 softfp ABI，高位共享寄存器组由端口保存； 完整低位寄存器组和 VPR 依赖硬件扩展异常栈帧，仍属物理切换验收。 编译合同不保证跨世界有效数据保留。"
msgstr "M55/M85 use real context ports with MVE support. `configENABLE_FPU` enables shared coprocessor registers and extended/lazy frames for FP or MVE; scalar-FP facts remain independent. Integer-only MVE uses `+nofp` and softfp ABI. The port saves upper shared registers, while the complete lower register bank and VPR depend on hardware extended exception frames and remain subject to physical switch acceptance. Compile contracts do not guarantee cross-world payload retention."

msgid "宿主实现与持续等待"
msgstr "Host implementation and sustained waiting"

msgid "FreeRTOS 宿主验证夹具保留锁定内核／POSIX 端口，使用自有 `tests/contracts/os_freertos_runtime/posix_event.c`。端口先取消正在等待条件变量的 pthread，再发送信号并等待退出；上游事件支持缺少取消清理，可能留下锁住的 互斥量。自有等待在返回和取消时都解锁，避免重复任务等待退出死锁； 此修正只作用于宿主，不改变 MCU 后端，也不建立 MCU 调度器资格。"
msgstr "The FreeRTOS host fixture retains the locked kernel/POSIX port and uses owned `tests/contracts/os_freertos_runtime/posix_event.c`. The port first cancels a pthread waiting on a condition variable, then signals and joins it. Upstream event support lacks cancellation cleanup and can leave a locked mutex. The owned wait unlocks on both return and cancellation, preventing repeated task-join deadlocks. This fix is host-only: it changes no MCU backend and establishes no MCU scheduler qualification."

msgid "有限通知截止时间在合并序列提示后也检查；无关连续 唤醒不能延长预算。超时后最终再观察判定条件，真实完成可以赢得 竞争。队列保留立即尝试语义，仅阻塞时消费绝对预算； `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` 使用真实无时限宿主等待。"
msgstr "Finite notification deadlines are checked even after merging sequence hints; unrelated continuous wakes cannot extend the budget. A final predicate check after timeout lets real completion win the race. Queues preserve immediate-try semantics and consume absolute budgets only when blocking. `NX_DEADLINE_NEVER` uses real untimed host waits."

msgid "任务创建在内核变更前验证端口启动栈帧／对齐，最小 栈帧不等于运行栈预算。每个可返回任务由唯一外部责任者等待退出；Native 任务 不得绕过适配器取消任务或执行 pthread detach。永久任务、直接通知是显式 可选瘦路径，有独立存储和接收者／索引合同。"
msgstr "Task creation validates the port’s startup frame/alignment before kernel mutation. A minimum frame is not a runtime stack budget. Every returnable task has one external join owner. Native tasks must not bypass the adapter to cancel tasks or pthread-detach. Permanent tasks and direct notifications are explicit optional lean paths with separate storage and receiver/index contracts."

msgid "关闭、低功耗与验证"
msgstr "Shutdown, low power and verification"

msgid "可关闭队列用独立调用者持有控制对象和每操作等待者，原始队列保持最小 原生阻塞实现。关闭时依次关闭准入，保持责任者推进服务，结清并等待生产者退出，再等待责任者 退出，撤销并排空硬件 IRQ 发布源，最后销毁 通知／队列／保护区。外部 UART 责任者示例演示此流程。"
msgstr "Closable queues use a separate caller-owned control object and per-operation waiters, while raw queues retain minimal native blocking behavior. Shutdown closes admission, keeps the owner servicing, settles and joins producers, joins the owner, withdraws/drains hardware IRQ publishers, and only then destroys notifications, queues and guards. The external UART owner example demonstrates this sequence."

msgid "无节拍空闲仅在显式定时器端口和连续时钟完整绑定时启用，否则普通 Tick 继续。诊断用调用者指定容量的环形存储和默认无操作的弱钩子。追踪、低功耗、任务 隔离不自动建立物理资格。`tools/hil/os_acceptance.py` 准备或 验证保留的 OS 硬件记录，不操作设备，未执行项仍是 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "Tickless idle is enabled only with an explicit timer port and fully bound continuous clock; otherwise ordinary Tick continues. Diagnostics use a caller-sized ring and a default no-op weak hook. Tracing, low power and task isolation do not automatically establish physical qualification. `tools/hil/os_acceptance.py` prepares or validates retained OS hardware records without operating devices; unexecuted items remain `not_executed`."

msgid "维护状态见[OS 交付](/delivery/os.md)、 {download}`OS01–OS55 台账 </design/os-execution.csv>`。新内核遵循 [后端接入合同](/design/os-backend-integration.md)并执行实际探针；探针 通过本身不登记新的受支持 RTOS。"
msgstr "See [OS delivery](/delivery/os.md) and the {download}`OS01–OS55 ledger </design/os-execution.csv>` for maintained status. A new kernel follows the [backend integration contract](/design/os-backend-integration.md) and executes real probes. Passing a probe alone does not register a new supported RTOS."

