msgstr "Common components"

msgid "可选通用组件"
msgstr "Optional common components"

msgid "本目录提供可复用的器件协议、共享资源组合、存储与中间件机制。组件通过明确的窄端口 连接公共 I/O、时钟与外部策略；应用提供实例存储、执行者、预算和停机顺序。组件不 选择产品引脚、业务寄存器、默认任务或全局设备名称。"
msgstr "This directory provides reusable device protocols, shared-resource compositions, storage and middleware mechanisms. Components connect public I/O, clocks and external policies through explicit narrow ports. Applications supply instance storage, executors, budgets and shutdown order. Components select neither product pins, business registers, default tasks nor global device names."

