msgid "通用机制保留在具名组件目录。精确 STM32 扩展位于 `components/soc/stm32/`，包括 选定 F407 handoff／I2S2、H563 I3C、H743 映射存储、H747 AMP 与 U575 低功耗机制。 目录归组不扩大芯片、后端、时钟、安全态或物理资格；各扩展保留自己的精确合同。"
msgstr "Generic mechanisms remain in named component directories. Exact STM32 extensions live in `components/soc/stm32/`, including selected F407 handoff/I2S2, H563 I3C, H743 mapped storage, H747 AMP and U575 low-power mechanisms. Directory grouping expands neither chip, backend, clock, security-state nor physical qualification; each extension retains its exact contract."

msgid "选择、存储与执行"
msgstr "Selection, storage and execution"

msgid "CMake 管理组件源码依赖。已有 assembly component 列表、显式 `LIBRARIES` 和 中间件创建 helper 各有维护范围，不能假定所有 target 都能在 TOML 中选择。 未引用的组件代码不进入固件镜像；`EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL` 不等于配置期没有依赖， 网络冷态源码闭包的既有问题见 [#52](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/issues/52)。"
msgstr "CMake manages component-source dependencies. Existing assembly-component lists, explicit `LIBRARIES` and middleware creation helpers each have maintained scopes; do not assume every target is selectable in TOML. Unreferenced component code does not enter the firmware image. `EXCLUDE_FROM_ALL` does not mean no configure-time dependency; see [#52](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/issues/52) for the existing network cold-source-closure issue."

msgid "基础组件不创建堆、工作线程或最大对象池。可选 lwIP 使用明确池，TLS 可在调用者提供 的 arena 中子分配；必须按所选 profile 预算，不能将全部中间件统称为内部无分配。"
msgstr "Base components create no heap, worker thread or maximum-object pool. Optional lwIP uses explicit pools, and TLS may suballocate within a caller-provided arena. Budget the selected profile rather than describing all middleware as internally allocation-free."

msgid "owner 有唯一执行者、精确 slot 容量、稳定取消代次和调用者提供的 operation。初始化 在发布前连接空闲 slot；准入在短 metadata guard 内取一个空闲项并追加 FIFO，结清或 拒绝时归还一个项，工作量与容量无关。同一 link 复用为空闲链或 FIFO 链，每个 owner 仅有一个 free-head，不增加每 slot 存储。最终 epoch 后 slot 永久退休，不重用身份。 UART owner 的独立 inner request 保证 provider 最后访问结束后才能释放 outer request。"
msgstr "An owner has one executor, exact slot capacity, stable cancellation epochs and caller-provided operations. Initialization links free slots before publication. Admission removes one free item and appends it to the FIFO under a short metadata guard; settlement/rejection returns one item, with work independent of capacity. The same link serves the free list or FIFO, with only one free-head per owner and no extra per-slot storage. Slots retire permanently after the final epoch; identities are never reused. The UART owner’s separate inner request prevents outer-request release until the provider’s final access has ended."

msgid "失败与验证"
msgstr "Failure and verification"

msgid "请求被接受后保持借用，直到 acquire 观察 `SETTLED`；取消、超时与失败排空不撤销 借用。生产者、观察者、通知发布者与 executor 分别退出会合后，才能回收其存储。"
msgstr "An accepted request remains borrowed until `SETTLED` is observed with acquire semantics; cancellation, timeout and failed drains do not revoke loans. Reclaim storage only after separately joining producers, observers, notification publishers and the executor."

msgid "`tests/contracts` 与 GoogleTest／GoogleMock 维护并发提交、迟到取消／TC、隔离恢复、 中断持久化写入及畸形协议输入等回归。主机文件持久化不建立物理 Flash 掉电资格。 组件的具体实现、执行记录与实板状态分别阅读，不从目录或 target 存在推断全部支持。"
msgstr "`tests/contracts` and GoogleTest/GoogleMock maintain regressions for concurrent submission, late cancellation/TC, quarantine recovery, interrupted persistence writes and malformed protocol inputs. Host file persistence establishes no physical Flash power-loss qualification. Read component implementation, execution records and physical-board status separately; directory or target existence does not imply complete support."

msgid "选定网络与启动合同"
msgstr "Selected network and boot contracts"

msgid "[网络组件合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/network/README.md)维护适配器执行、复制 TCP 字节、 TX 结果观察和退出责任。{ref}`选定 RX payload 借用合同 <lwip-loaned-rx-contract>` 维护可选 copied／loaned profile，以及公共接口与 Storage target 的分界。最后一次 pbuf free 只把 loan 标记为可归还，串行 owner 随后释放精确 MAC loan；存在引用或 释放失败时继续保留存储。这些机制不建立 PHY 接线、DMA／Cache 或实板资格。"
msgstr "The [network component contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/network/README.md) maintains adapter execution, copied TCP bytes, TX result observation and exit responsibilities. The {ref}`selected RX payload borrowing contract <lwip-loaned-rx-contract>` maintains optional copied/loaned profiles and the boundary between public interfaces and the Storage target. The final pbuf free only marks a loan returnable; the serial owner later releases the exact MAC loan. References or failed release retain storage. These mechanisms establish no PHY-wiring, DMA/Cache or physical-board qualification."

msgid "[MCUboot 组件合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/mcuboot/README.md)维护选定 overwrite-only profile、显式 Flash 组合、boot／application 所有权图及产品恢复责任。 {ref}`公共控制 API <mcuboot-control-contract>`只展示通用 C11 头，具体 Flash port 类型和私有 boot／profile 头不属于该接口。模型与链接结果不建立掉电或实物 Flash 资格。"
msgstr "The [MCUboot component contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/mcuboot/README.md) maintains the selected overwrite-only profile, explicit Flash composition, boot/application ownership graph and product recovery responsibilities. The {ref}`public control API <mcuboot-control-contract>` exposes only generic C11 headers; concrete Flash-port types and private boot/profile headers are outside that interface. Model and link results establish neither power-loss nor physical Flash qualification."

msgid "精确 SoC 集成"
msgstr "Exact SoC integration"

msgid "SoC 芯片集成与私有实现"
msgstr "SoC chip integration and private implementations"

msgid "本层负责精确芯片的启动、时钟、时间域、内存、IRQ／DMA，以及公共 I/O 的具体实现。 MCU 源码按厂家和已维护系列组织；`stm32f407`、`gd32f470` 等公共系列标识保持独立， 不可变 family descriptor 给出唯一源码目录。目录层级不新增配置权威或运行时注册表。"
msgstr "This layer owns startup, clocks, time domains, memory, IRQ/DMA and concrete public-I/O implementations for exact chips. MCU source is grouped by vendor and maintained family. Public family identifiers such as `stm32f407` and `gd32f470` remain independent; an immutable family descriptor supplies the unique source directory. Directory hierarchy adds neither a configuration authority nor a runtime registry."

