msgid "各 MCU family 拥有 `soc.json`、`routes.json`、私有 controller 状态、选定驱动源码 和明确的 CMake target。其 `configure/` 负责系列能力、准入、静态构造描述及生命周期 调用顺序。配置测试仍位于 `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`；共享解析、 不可变 IR、资源仲裁与 bundle 事务由 `tools/configure/` 维护。"
msgstr "Each MCU family owns `soc.json`, `routes.json`, private controller state, selected driver source and explicit CMake targets. Its `configure/` owns family capabilities, admission, static construction descriptions and lifecycle call order. Configuration tests remain in `tools/configure/tests/providers/<family>/`; `tools/configure/` maintains shared parsing, immutable IR, resource arbitration and bundle transactions."

msgid "实际硬件算法直接由本 family 的 C 代码持有。启动、clock、timebase、memory 和 power 也留在本层。可复用 IP 算法进入 [drivers](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/drivers/README.md)，但每个 wrapper 仍须检查真实厂商布局、bit、clock、IRQ／DMA 和 errata；外设同名不证明硬件等价。"
msgstr "The family’s C code directly owns actual hardware algorithms. Startup, clocks, timebase, memory and power also remain in this layer. Reusable IP algorithms go in [drivers](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/drivers/README.md), but each wrapper must still check actual vendor layout, bits, clocks, IRQ/DMA and errata. Matching peripheral names do not prove hardware equivalence."

