msgid "图表示源码和维护责任，不增加运行时转发层。`common/uart_control.h` 是跨厂家协作 合同；`stm32/common/stm32_identity.h` 是 STM32 身份辅助，两者都不是通用外设算法。"
msgstr "The figure expresses source and maintenance responsibilities without adding a runtime forwarding layer. `common/uart_control.h` is a cross-vendor collaboration contract; `stm32/common/stm32_identity.h` is an STM32 identity helper. Neither is a generic peripheral algorithm."

