msgid "[Board 包](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/README.md)授权已审 PCB 绑定。新增 Board 不会自动开放新时钟树； 须选择精确已维护 clock profile，或实现并验证新的 profile。未维护的振荡源、domain、 mode 和 silicon revision 必须明确拒绝。"
msgstr "[Board packages](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/boards/README.md) authorize reviewed PCB bindings. A new Board does not automatically enable a new clock tree. Select an exact maintained clock profile, or implement and verify a new one. Reject unmaintained oscillators, domains, modes and silicon revisions explicitly."

msgid "接入顺序见 [provider 指南](/guides/provider-porting.md)，可选路线和模式见 [派生能力矩阵](/delivery/capabilities.md)，实际证据见 [资格说明](/reference/platforms/qualification.md)。CPU 支持、SDK 宏或目录存在 均不建立整系列支持；MCU 实板 HIL 仍为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr "See the [provider guide](/guides/provider-porting.md) for integration order, the [derived capability matrix](/delivery/capabilities.md) for selectable routes/modes and [qualification](/reference/platforms/qualification.md) for actual evidence. CPU support, SDK macros or directory existence establish no whole-family support. MCU physical HIL remains `not_executed`."

