msgid "本目录按控制器类别和受审 IP 协议组织私有算法。精确 SoC 目标用自身 ABI 和私有 include 路径直接编译所需源码。公共接口对象／请求所有权归 I/O， 芯片时钟、路线、启动、内存和具体实现状态归 SoC。这是源码归属边界， 不增加运行时层、注册表、分配、队列或工作线程。"
msgstr "This directory groups private algorithms by controller kind and reviewed IP protocol. Exact SoC targets compile required source directly with their own ABI and private include paths. I/O owns public interface objects/request ownership; SoC owns chip clocks, routes, startup, memory and implementation state. This source-ownership boundary adds no runtime layer, registry, allocation, queue or worker."

