msgid "`Nexus::DriverPrivateHeaders` 只提供私有构建期 include 路径，消费者私有 链接；不包含固件源码、对象或状态。精确 SoC 是唯一源码选择器。 公共检查分派、数据帧验证、序列所有权、日历运算 仍在 I/O。CAN 的 `cortex_m_port.h` 私有维护字节优先级／字访问 NVIC 访问； Native 在包含前替换同一宏，不增加公共 Arch API、不改中断排序。 H743／U575 共用四字节不可变 `uart_fifo_profile.h` 布局，SoC 别名保留精确 入口类型，不增加运行时链接。"
msgstr "`Nexus::DriverPrivateHeaders` supplies only private build-time include paths and consumers link it privately. It contains no firmware source, objects or state. Exact SoC targets are the sole source selectors. Public checked dispatch, data-frame validation, sequence ownership and calendar arithmetic remain in I/O. CAN `cortex_m_port.h` privately maintains byte-priority/word-NVIC access; Native overrides the same macros before inclusion without adding public Arch APIs or changing interrupt ordering. H743/U575 share the four-byte immutable `uart_fifo_profile.h` layout; SoC aliases retain exact entry-point types with no added runtime link."

msgid "共享条件与实例隔离"
msgstr "Sharing conditions and instance isolation"

msgid "共享依据是硬件协议和受审硅片语义，不是厂家或寄存器名字相同。SoC 适配层对照实际 SDK 寄存器偏移与位掩码，提供时钟、DMA／IRQ、可见内存， 并绑定选定静态状态。它们不因此继承另一芯片的路由、引脚接线、时钟或 勘误策略。"
msgstr "Sharing depends on hardware protocol and reviewed silicon semantics, not matching vendors or register names. SoC wrappers check actual SDK register offsets/bit masks, supply clocks, DMA/IRQ and visible memory, and bind selected static state. They do not inherit another chip’s routes, pin wiring, clocks or errata policy."

msgid "I2C V1 由 F407、GD470、F103、GD303 共用。前两者保留受审 100 kHz，8 MHz 低端 两款因 ES096 2.8.1／2.8.5 和 GD32F30x 限制 2.8.1，使用名义 80 kHz、 优先级为零且不调用内核的 IRQ，无 I2C DMA。F4 流式 DMA 布局不复用于固定通道 控制器。已捕获唤醒发布者等待退出后才停止并归还通知存储； 向量撤销拒绝时保留已初始化责任者，待显式重试。"
msgstr "F407, GD470, F103 and GD303 share I2C V1. The first pair retains reviewed 100 kHz operation. Because of ES096 2.8.1/2.8.5 and GD32F30x limitations 2.8.1, the 8 MHz low-end pair uses nominal 80 kHz, priority-zero non-kernel IRQs and no I2C DMA. F4 stream-DMA layout is not reused for fixed-channel controllers. Captured wake publishers join before stop returns notification storage; refused vector withdrawal retains the initialized owner for explicit retry."

msgid "UART V1 通道 DMA 为精确 F103／GD303 共享，适配层独立断言旧式 USART 和 固定通道 DMA 位掩码与布局。`dma-tx` 占一 TX 通道和显式 IRQ 字节环； `dma-duplex` 占两通道与调用者提供有限 RX 块。线上 TC 与 DMA 内存完成分开；引擎撤每个请求源、观察稳定剩余计数、确认标志后 才归还缓冲区。无法证明撤销时保留请求／生产者借用。普通 RX 由 责任者推进服务重启，具有明确间隙／背压，不覆盖消费方块。有限 边界丢弃 DATA 字节时记录丢失，不据此提供循环 RX 或 Cache 合同。"
msgstr "The exact F103/GD303 implementations share UART V1 channel DMA. Wrappers independently assert legacy USART and fixed-channel DMA masks/layout. `dma-tx` owns one TX channel and an explicit IRQ byte ring; `dma-duplex` owns two channels and caller-provided finite RX blocks. Wire TC is separate from DMA memory completion. The engine withdraws each request source, observes stable remaining counts and acknowledges flags before returning buffers. Unprovable withdrawal retains request/producer loans. Normal RX restarts through owner service with explicit gaps/backpressure and never overwrites consumer blocks. A DATA byte discarded at a finite boundary records loss; this grants neither circular RX nor a Cache contract."

msgid "仅硬件协议一致时共享逐字节操作；冷态验证、NVIC 撤销和芯片 资源仍归适配层。协议／勘误不同须新受审实现或精确窄能力，不能在 热路径加入推测家族分支。STM32 身份访问位于 `soc/stm32/common/stm32_identity.h`，跨厂商 SoC 控制合同位于 `soc/common/uart_control.h`。"
msgstr "Share per-byte operations only for identical hardware protocols. Cold validation, NVIC withdrawal and chip resources remain in wrappers. Different protocols/errata need a newly reviewed implementation or an explicit narrow capability, not speculative family branches in a hot path. STM32 identity access is in `soc/stm32/common/stm32_identity.h`; the cross-vendor SoC control contract is in `soc/common/uart_control.h`."

msgid "接入与验证"
msgstr "Integration and verification"

msgid "CMake 是唯一源码图，未选算法不能因文件存在而编译。检查选定源码的真实 链接保留情况和 Flash／RAM 成本。寄存器边界模型执行真实引擎与适配层， 覆盖拒绝、错误、取消、失败排空、实例隔离；每个选定 ARM 实现分别编译。Native 模型与 ARM 链接建立不同软件属性， 时序／电气必须物理执行。"
msgstr "CMake is the sole source graph; unselected algorithms must not compile merely because their files exist. Check actual linked retention and Flash/RAM cost of selected source. Register-boundary models execute real engines/wrappers and cover rejection, errors, cancellation, failed drains and instance isolation. Compile each selected ARM implementation separately. Native models and ARM links establish different software properties; timing/electrical behavior requires physical execution."

msgid "维护入口见[执行预算](/design/soc-execution-budgets.md)与 [provider 接入指南](/guides/provider-porting.md)。"
msgstr "See [execution budgets](/design/soc-execution-budgets.md) and the [provider integration guide](/guides/provider-porting.md) for maintenance entry points."

msgid "精确实现边界与参考配置分别见 [STM32F103](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f103/README.md)、 [GD32F303](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/gd32/gd32f303/README.md)、 [STM32F407](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f407/README.md)、 [GD32F470](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/gd32/gd32f470/README.md)、 [STM32G474](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32g474/README.md)、 [STM32H743](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/README.md)和 [STM32U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/README.md)。站点链接绑定当前文档 revision， 每个 family 的完整退出条件和实际证据仍以对应合同为准。"
msgstr "See [STM32F103](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f103/README.md), [GD32F303](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/gd32/gd32f303/README.md), [STM32F407](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f407/README.md), [GD32F470](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/gd32/gd32f470/README.md), [STM32G474](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32g474/README.md), [STM32H743](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32h743/README.md) and [STM32U575](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/README.md) for exact implementation boundaries and reference configurations. Site links bind to the current documentation revision; each family’s full exit conditions and actual evidence remain governed by its own contract."

